Seeing that new ideas are being thrown about like there is no
tomorrow, here are a few of mine. Some are just enhancements to
current things, and easy to implement. Others are maybe a bit more
complex, but none are too way out.

In no particular order:

o	devil's horns left from a horned devil. I don't know what you
	could do with it, but compare to a unicorn horn.

o	devils carry pitchforks, maybe which give special effects.
	Only chaotic characters can use them.

o	more sorts of monsters:
	o	were-felines
	o	ghosts - spectres, poltergeists, phantoms
	o	seducers - eg. sirens
	o	witches and warlocks - and a new room, a coven
	o	a unique super nurse - the Florence Nightingale
		(carries a lamp) 
	o	good, neutral and evil faeries that help you along,
		like a pet, but with simple magic, to help balance out
		all of that extra magic I've just suggested

o	chameleons can turn into a doppelganger - same level,
	knowledge, hp and AC as you. (Don't leave any weapons or armour
	when they die.)

o	nasty rooms - one to each maze level, in order to spice them
	up. Just make a room before the maze is started and fill in
	around it.  It has a door.

